## WHAT THIS PROJECT IS

FocusFlow-jvm is a Kotlin + Compose Multiplatform Desktop app.
It currently runs on Windows with real Win32 enforcement:
process kill via JNA, firewall rules via netsh, hosts-file
blocking, kiosk mode, PIN gates, and a system tray.

Your job is to add Linux support alongside all of that.
Windows must keep working exactly as before.

