### 4. Build system — build.gradle.kts
Add Linux packaging targets:
  packageDeb       → .deb package
  packageRpm       → .rpm package
  packageAppImage  → AppImage (most portable)

These use the Compose Desktop Gradle plugin which already
supports them. Add them without removing the Windows targets.

### 5. GitHub Actions — .github/workflows/
